body:
[A10] Evidence addendum for R519-2-F1. The head is unchanged at `c4539ff1`.

The final-head OOC measurement record and its inputs are now published under `review-evidence/pp163-r1/author-r3/measurement-m3final/` (archive `7e552ca5` on kebag-logic/milan-fpga, branch `pp163-review-evidence`). That covers:
- the record output, with `inputs_sha256` `24ba6a24…`;
- the generated OOC and integrated recipes (`baseline_ooc.tcl`, `baseline_integrated.tcl`, `elaborate.tcl`);
- `baseline_parameters.json`, `baseline_concurrency.json` (the concurrency-only recipe change), `baseline_chparam.txt` and `baseline_images.json`;
- the clock and board XDC files;
- the image audit;
- the gate, cone and paths outputs, each with its exit code.

R519-3 will verify these at the same head.
